    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's hard to even think about \"perspectives\" or \"support\" right now. it just feels like a joke. i spent years believing in integrity and the system, and the system just spat me out the second i stopped being useful to them. i look around and all i see is people making deals with monsters just to survive. there's no real justice, is there? it's just a cycle of people getting stepped on until they're gone. i'm just so tired of the fight.",
